{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"850780876140183553","content":"this is sorta what non gold payment looks like:\n**Payment Options**:\nWhile item trading is the norm… other payment options are available. These should be decided by a DM only and based on the character in question. Feel free to give the player options. Bartering is the norm here. At the end of the day you want something as precious to them as the service/good they are requesting. \n**You got off easy: (common/uncommon)**\nYou are exhausted \nLose memory of first kiss\nThe last time you felt at home\nLose ability to talk quietly \n“you develop shaky hands” = disadvantage on sleight of hand checks\nLose a language, not common \nPermission to enter dreams for a week\n**Eh, you coulda done worse: (uncommon/rare)**\n“you lose a precious childhood memory” = one of the proficiencies granted by your background is lost forever\nGrief of losing a loved one\n“You lose some of your longevity” = Age 5 years\n= Lose darkvision\n-1 from stat\nThe comfort of hugs\nMemory of home altogether\nShrink by one size, adjust carrying capacity and speed accordingly \nYou are exhausted for 1 week, magic cannot cure this (terrible nightmares?)\nGonging sound in your ears dis on concentration checks\nUnable to speak on fridays\nOffhand turns to wood, unable to hold items in it\nLevel 3 exhaustion \n**Ouch, you got feyed hard: (very rare/wondrous)**\n-2 from stat\nLose attunement slot\nLose 2 Proficiencies \nTotal amnesia of identity \nLose Hearing (thieves cant is canonical sign language)\nAge 5d6 years immediately\nUnable to speak Common\nLose ability of DMs choosing","created_at":"2021-07-09T02:40:03.860000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-09T02:40:51.391000Z","id":"862885789502406696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
